# Deploy through GitHub Actions

Images for Cloud Run service `shin` are built and deployed only by `.github/workflows/deploy.yml`, after a push to `main`.

- Do not run `gcloud builds submit` or use Cloud Build.
- Do not build or push images from this machine, and do not run `gcloud run deploy` by hand.
- To ship a change: commit it, then ask the user before pushing (see `no-git-push.mdc`). The push starts the workflow.
- Read-only `gcloud` commands (describe, list, logs) are fine for checking the result.

```text
# Bad
gcloud builds submit --tag us-central1-docker.pkg.dev/shin-512818/shin/shin:latest .

# Good
"The change is committed. Should I push to origin/main so GitHub Actions deploys it?"
```
